The carrier’s generating-set clause supports D5: a tested input bit must take both values at each reachable state cell, so I withdraw the earlier parameter-versus-state distinction. One evidence claim needs narrowing: tables 20/20b test the slot rows; they do not independently kill all 48 cells. The slot-clear coverage comes from earlier tables.
